	(text "1. U1 FT232RL runs from +5V (C3 100 nF on VCC); 3V3OUT (internal LDO) feeds the 3.3 V side of JP1 (C4 1 uF)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 49.276 140.462 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 60 68 74 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e8080160-0834-4a0f-b2b8-7a416ee3f8ab")
	)
	(text "2. JP1: 1-2 = 5 V, 2-3 = 3.3 V. VOUT goes to VCCIO (pin 4, I/O level of TXD / RXD / DTR / RTS / CTS / CBUS) and to J2 pin 4."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 49.276 143.256 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 60 68 74 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1182facd-8cf0-4ed0-885d-60aa6141978c")
	)
	(text "3. CBUS0 = TXLED#, CBUS1 = RXLED# (factory EEPROM): D3 / D4 light while data moves."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 49.276 146.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 60 68 74 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ef783c46-c8dd-4dd3-9d76-cf51d7fd02af")
	)
	(text "4. Internal oscillator: OSCI / OSCO and RESET# are not used (No Connect)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 49.276 148.844 0)
		(effects
